"Cantrips": {
  "index": 1,
  "category": "manaweaving",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Cantrips"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Cantrips",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " are spells that I can cast using nothing but manaweaving. \n\nI learn new cantrips every time I tier up."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "The Cantrip GUI"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Cantrips can be customized so that any combination of two or more manaweaving patterns will cast it.\n\nIf I want to customize cantrips, all I need to do is hold any manaweaver wand in my hand and "
        },
        {
          "text": "focus",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "(press the gui key, default control, and right click. The wand's tooltip will show this as well)",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nOnce in the gui, I can look at "
        },
        {
          "text": "(hover over)",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": " any of the cantrip icons to recall what the cantrip does. I can also change the patterns required for that cantrip"
        },
        {
          "text": " (minimum 2, use the arrows next to the boxes below each cantrip's icon)",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Some cantrips require items as well that are related to that cantrip. For example the 'Freeform Spell' cantrips require that I place a spell into the inventory slot before they'll do anything meaningful.",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Casting Cantrips"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "To cast a cantrip, first I'll need a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Manaweaving Wand",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nI must draw the patterns in order using standard manaweaving. "
        },
        {
          "text": "Patterns that are drawn close enough to each other will merge together",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".  It is these merged patterns that can cast cantrips.\n\nOnce a cantrip pattern is matched, I will hear a tone and will have a few seconds before the cantrip activates. For cantrips that must be aimed such as Ignite, or Freeform Spells, it will target and cast where I am looking after that delay."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "location": "mna:vinteum_manaweaver_wand",
      "type": "crafting"
    },
    {
      "location": "mna:chimerite_manaweaver_wand",
      "type": "crafting"
    },
    {
      "type": "crafting",
      "location": "mna:improvised_manaweaver_wand"
    }
  ]
}